      "short": "Buy uptime",
      "chapter": "tradeoff",
      "title": "Availability is a thing you buy",
      "body": [
        "Each replica costs as much as the primary. Availability is a thing you buy, not a setting you flip.",
        "<span class=\"term\">Observability</span> isn't optional at this scale — without monitoring you learn about outages from Twitter."
      ],
